Subject: Cantor Self Work Physical Update Broker Data Design

@ [data_design_uuid] cf3f1749-a1b5-4ca5-b2c8-efc12b51f29f
@ [canonical_uuid] 5f178438-8dad-4d96-be46-66c75b881f1b

& [DesignRule]
  + pure decoded metadata describes what must be bound while separately owned runtime carriers embody any effect capability
  + no serialized record can reconstruct a runtime carrier or widen the commission that produced it

& [BrokerRoot]
  + identity fields bind broker correlation source canonical profile lifecycle checkpoint step attempt objective handoff request proposal workspace base branch Git allowlist proposed changes stage plan capability account and unresolved frontier
  + BrokerRoot is strict bounded deterministic and self-digested

& [StagePlan]
  + ordered stage definitions fix stage kind input profile output profile producer class required capability set forbidden capability set verifier consequence policy and resource ceiling
  + B0 through B5 identities are unique and monotonic
  + optional B5 is present as a planned stage even when no rollback is commissioned so absence cannot imply cleanup

& [CapabilityAccount]
  + closed CapabilityKind enumeration contains twenty-three distinct kinds
  + granted and explicitly_not_granted are sorted unique disjoint and exhaustive
  + capability_account_sha256 is bound into BrokerRoot every StageCommission and every StageReceipt

& [StageCommission]
  + exact identifiers are commission broker stage predecessor producer activation signature input output roots policies resources timeout consequence verifier and self-digest
  + activation_signature_ref is syntactically represented but semantically unavailable to B0 formation fixtures
  + single_use_identity is derived from commission broker stage and predecessor

& [StageReceipt]
  + common envelope binds profile broker stage commission producer predecessor input output resources physical_contact consequence unresolved capability account and self-digest
  + stage-specific payloads are FormationValidationRecord PreflightRecord MutationRunRecord PostStateEvidenceRecord IndependentReviewRecord RollbackRecord and BrokerHandoffRecord
  + payload profiles are closed and cross-stage substitution refuses

& [EvidenceReferences]
  + ImmutableEvidenceRef binds root-admission receipt content digest bytes media profile verifier and producer without carrying root custody
  + raw event and content bytes remain external bounded artifacts
  + B0 fixtures use synthetic evidence references with physical_contact false and no filesystem path claim

& [FaultRecord]
  + exact class stage operation message physical_contact may_have_mutated quarantine_required evidence prefix unresolved and self-digest fields
  + false may_have_mutated is legal only before B2 turn start is proven absent
  + post-start faults and unknown child state structurally require quarantine

& [DispositionTypes]
  + B0 is FormationValidated only
  + B1 is PreflightEligible or refused
  + B2 is MutationTerminated or quarantined fault
  + B3 is PostStateSealed or quarantined fault
  + B4 is AcceptedForSWA05Consideration RefusedPreserve Quarantined or Unresolved
  + B5 is RollbackVerified RollbackIncomplete RollbackFaulted or QuarantinedWithoutCleanup

& [Serialization]
  + strict deterministic JSON denies unknown fields defaults duplicate keys noncanonical UUID or digest text unsorted sets and oversized values
  + self-digests are domain-separated and omit only their own field
  + aggregate B0 metadata is at most 262144 bytes and collection-specific maxima are fixed by StagePlan

& [OwnershipAndVisibility]
  + pure metadata values may be owned cloned serialized and decoded within explicit bounds
  + physical handles roots process owners reviewer contexts keys and rollback executors are private nonserializable noncloneable runtime carriers under future stage implementations
  + no public constructor conversion default environment lookup global registry or hidden recovery joins metadata to runtime carriers

& [VerificationModel]
  + B0 provider-free implementation can prove encoding digest partition transition consequence and refusal semantics without physical contact
  + B1 through B5 require separate injected or physical carriers and independent evidence specified by later activation sources
  + compile-time or static surface tests must prove B0 has no effect imports and no physical receipt constructor

& [Decision]
  + data design is closed for formation
  + exact Rust type shape remains a later B0 activation-source decision
  + no dependency Cargo or production-code change is authorized
